/* A PHONE ON ITS SIDE (~874x402). The pinned brand, steps and nav took ~250px and left the grid 30-70px,
   and the 16:9 stage left gutters either side. Here the creator takes the stage's whole width and the
   FRAME is the one scroll region: brand and steps scroll away with the fields, and the nav stays pinned,
